00:17:16,720 --> 00:19:18,800
The donghua makes Wang Lin triggering the execution order look like an accident. In the novel, it wasn't...

Wang Lin stopped. He glanced at the token before his cold gaze locked onto Qian Kun. After Li Muwan saw the token, she hesitated before taking a closer look and was startled. She said, “That is the Hundred Days Execution Order. I can’t believe the Sea of Devils has this kind of treasure. I have only seen it in ancient records.”

Li Muwan quickly explained the details of the token to Wang Lin. Her breathing was ragged by the time she was finished and there was a sense of dread in her eyes when she looked at the token.

Qian Kun was really afraid that Wang Lin wouldn’t recognize the token. If Wang Lin didn’t believe him and killed him anyways, it would be really bad.
However, after seeing the girl explaining it, he finally relaxed.

He didn’t believe that there would be someone who would be willing to kill after learning of the effect of the execution order. He relaxed in his heart and said, “Fellow cultivator, what do you think of my proposal? Don’t be too stubborn. If you were to really kill me, you would be marked by the execution order and it would create a lot of trouble for you. The girl with you will also be dragged in as well, so don't be like this.”

Wang Lin didn’t even look at Qian Kun. He turned to Li Muwan and asked,“Are you sure? If I can last 100 days, I can obtain all of his cultivation?”

Li Muwan took a deep breath and nodded.

Qian Kun’s heart skipped a beat as he realized that something was wrong. He started to back away, but Wang Lin’s cold gaze suddenly locked onto him. Wang Lin spat out one word: “Die!”

265
00:17:22,190 --> 00:17:28,080
I've been walking this path for endless years

266
00:17:24,490 --> 00:17:28,080
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

267
00:17:28,470 --> 00:17:33,680
Is it the compass of fate

268
00:17:30,310 --> 00:17:33,680
that wrote this outcome for us ?

269
00:17:33,590 --> 00:17:39,600
The heavens want to erase your existence,

270
00:17:39,470 --> 00:17:45,320
that's the obsession guiding me.

271
00:17:45,350 --> 00:17:50,920
Is this the path to uncover

272
00:17:47,230 --> 00:17:50,920
truths from falsehoods ?

273
00:17:50,950 --> 00:17:56,520
In a world of murk and shadow,

274
00:17:52,850 --> 00:17:56,520
only the flame of truth can light the way.

275
00:17:56,310 --> 00:18:02,240
Look at them all,

276
00:17:59,190 --> 00:18:02,240
being carried by the waves.

277
00:18:02,430 --> 00:18:06,880
Look at them all,

278
00:18:04,590 --> 00:18:06,880
being drowned.

279
00:18:06,710 --> 00:18:10,200
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

280
00:18:09,990 --> 00:18:13,280
I will let the world refine my soul.

281
00:18:13,160 --> 00:18:18,840
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

282
00:18:14,850 --> 00:18:18,840
I will fight.

283
00:18:18,590 --> 00:18:21,960
I'll break through the abyss of despair

284
00:18:21,710 --> 00:18:25,000
to finally learn who I really am.

285
00:18:24,750 --> 00:18:30,360
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

286
00:18:26,630 --> 00:18:30,360
I embrace this obsession.

287
00:18:30,110 --> 00:18:33,320
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

288
00:18:33,070 --> 00:18:36,120
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

289
00:18:35,870 --> 00:18:41,600
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

290
00:18:37,910 --> 00:18:41,600
I'll still fight.

291
00:18:41,550 --> 00:18:44,960
It's hard to avoid loneliness

292
00:18:44,710 --> 00:18:48,000
when you are above everyone else.

293
00:18:47,750 --> 00:18:53,680
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

294
00:18:50,070 --> 00:18:53,680
be afraid of a firefly ?
